        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fabián Bielinsky, Murdock MacQuarrie, Allan Forrest, Helene Rosson\n- Places: Buenos Aires, San Francisco, California, Los Angeles, California\n- Works: The Sign of the Spade\n- Roles: film director, silent film actor\n\nFacts:\n- Murdock MacQuarrie was born on 25 August 1878 in San Francisco, California.\n- The Sign of the Spade is a 1916 silent film drama directed by Murdock MacQuarrie.\n- The Sign of the Spade starred Allan Forrest and Helene Rosson.\n- Fabián Bielinsky was born on 3 February 1959 in Buenos Aires.\n- Fabián Bielinsky was an Argentine film director.\n- Murdock MacQuarrie was an American silent film actor and director.\n- Murdock MacQuarrie died on 22 August 1942 in Los Angeles, California.\n- Fabián Bielinsky died on 28 June 2006.",
